    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### If something goes wrong\n- **The Apify run fails** (bad input, timeout, cost cap reached): the node retries once, then the execution stops before the Sheet or Slack is touched.\n- **No company meets the minimum:** the Sheet gets no rows and no Slack message is posted.\n- **Duplicates:** posts are de-duplicated by job ID within a run and grouped by LinkedIn company page. Each row has a `key` (week + company). A second run in the same week updates those rows instead of adding them again, and posts the Slack digest again.\n- For the Monday schedule, set an error workflow in **Workflow settings** to get notified.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 1060,
        "color": 3
      },
